WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:03.202
♪♪

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.238
-[ As Harry Styles ]
Oh, hello.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.773
You caught me in the middle of
telling myself a secret.

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:10.510
-Hi, Harry. I am going to
ask you 73 questions.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.979
Ready to do this?
-Come. Come.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:15.181
-Do you live alone?
-I do.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.950
-And how has your day been
so far?

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.153
-Well, I stepped
in a rain puddle

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:23.723
and accidentally got
a ladybug wet,

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.893
cried about it
for hours after, but...

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:30.329
I think I made things right,
because that ladybug

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:33.966
is going on tour with me
as my opening act.

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:36.202
-Last person you texted?

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.304
-My Uber driver
from three weeks ago,

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.972
just to say hello.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:43.275
-On a scale of 1 to 10,
how excited are you about life?

00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:45.078
-A number that I made up

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:49.749
that's impossible to communicate
vocally, only with a look,

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.585
specifically this look.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.221
-Least favorite color?

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.056
-Ultramarine blue.

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:59.825
-Favorite color?
-Magenta.

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:02.929
-What's the best gift
you ever received?

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.297
-A smile.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.600
And you know who gave it to me?
You.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.235
-Wow. Thank you.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.904
What's your favorite meal?

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.972
-A bowl of cream

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.941
topped with drizzled
raw honey

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:17.510
straight from the bee colony
I'm friends with,

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.979
and a handful of wizzle berries.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.647
-I'm sorry, wizzle berries?

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.817
-Yes, from the wizzle berry bush
that grows in an enchanted land

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.752
that's only accessible
from the old armoire

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:28.120
I keep in my garden.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:31.524
-What are you scared of?

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:35.895
-Letting my anxieties tear me
away from the present moment.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:38.898
Wait, no. Spiders.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.200
-What's your guilty pleasure?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.969
-Chocolate.
-Oh, nice. Simple.

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:46.873
-From the set of the original
"Willy Wonka" film.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:48.207
-Favorite movie?

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:51.810
-Life, directed by me.

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:54.747
Shot with my eyeballs.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.050
Coming soon to theaters
near...and far.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.119
[ Balloon deflates ]

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:03.255
-Best advice you ever got?

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:05.291
-You can save $2 a month
on Netflix

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:09.128
if you get the non-HD version.

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:10.729
-Where'd you get that guitar?

00:02:10.729 --> 00:02:12.232
-Guitar Center.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:14.433
-Where'd you get that piano?

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:16.335
-Guitar Center.

00:02:16.335 --> 00:02:18.137
-And what's in your cup?

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:19.872
-Vodka!

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:21.874
-Really?
-No, it's tea.

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:23.176
-How do you take your tea?

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:25.511
-With vodka!

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:26.879
-Dream collaborator?

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.881
-Sorry, mate.
I need to get going.

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:31.317
-But we still have so many
questions left.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.486
-I know, but I forgot
I already made plans

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.588
to blow a kiss
to my best friend,

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:38.357
a beluga whale wearing
a bellhop outfit.

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:39.892
Thanks for stopping by.

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:42.528
And remember, treat people
with kindness.

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:44.897
Cheers.
[ Door closes ]

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.867
♪ Chocolate kisses ♪
♪♪

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.669
♪ Chocolate kisses ♪

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:52.872
♪ Chocolate
kisses ♪

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.907
♪ Chocolate kisses ♪

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:56.509
I just made that up.

